      "url": "https://dexscreener.com/robinhood/0xd33d767607689f3db8d990004e1f266a4d9904d9",
      "description": "Pons Burn Book is the burn and lock registry for Robinhood Chain, and $PBB is the token that runs it.\n\nTwo verbs, one book. Lock an ERC20 until a timestamp and the registry holds it: the tokens physically cannot move before the unlock time, and there is no function anywhere in the contract that shortens a lock or releases one early. Burn an ERC20 and the balance goes to the dead address, gone for good. Every lock and every burn becomes a numbered page carrying the wallet, the token, the amount that actually arrived, the unlock time, the block and one line of text.\n\nA page is written by the contract from the transfer it received, not from a form, so a fee on transfer token records what landed rather than what was asked for. A live lock can be extended, topped up or handed to another wallet, and its owner can convert it into a burn at any moment, which writes a second page for the burn. After the unlock time the owner withdraws and the page stays in the book, marked closed.\n\nThe registry has no owner, no admin key, no pause, no upgrade path and no fee. Nobody can move what you lock, and nobody can rescue it either. It is deployed at 0x27189abc36d93e456bca452d6d2bde35bb4216d6 and reading the book costs nothing.\n\nRobinhood Chain, chain id 4663, Arbitrum Orbit, EVM, gas in ETH.\n\nBurn it or lock it, the page is permanent.",
